Let the satchel into other Curios slots <p>Add <code>faeriehollow:familiar_satchel</code> to that slot's item tag, for example <code>data/curios/tags/item/back.json</code> (1.21.1) or <code>data/curios/tags/items/back.json</code> (1.20.1):</p> <pre><code>{ "values": ["faeriehollow:familiar_satchel"] }
</code></pre> Remove Faerie Hollow's Curios slots <p>Override its slot assignments in a datapack, giving them to nobody:</p> data/faeriehollow/curios/entities/familiar_satchel.json<pre><code>{ "entities": [], "slots": ["familiar_satchel"] }
</code></pre> data/faeriehollow/curios/entities/faerie_favour.json<pre><code>{ "entities": [], "slots": ["necklace"] }
</code></pre> <p>Removing Curios from a world</p> <p>Take every satchel (and every other curio) out of the Curios slots first. Moving a world from 1.20.1 to 1.21.1 also loses Curios slots: see Updating and moving worlds.</p>
